WEBVTT

00:00:05.761 --> 00:00:07.580
<v><b>Instructor:</b></v> Hello, can I help you?

00:00:08.165 --> 00:00:11.666
<v><b>Anna:</b></v> Yes, can I book some driving lessons, please?

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:12.988
<v><b>Instructor:</b></v> Yes, of course.

00:00:13.124 --> 00:00:14.617
<v><b>Anna:</b></v> When can I start?

00:00:14.857 --> 00:00:18.494
<v><b>Instructor:</b></v> I’m free on Monday. We can meet at your house.

00:00:18.966 --> 00:00:20.698
<v><b>Anna:</b></v> Can you come at 8.30?

00:00:23.354 --> 00:00:27.320
<v><b>Instructor:</b></v> No, sorry, I can’t. I have a lesson at 8.00.

00:00:27.654 --> 00:00:31.599
<v><b>Anna:</b></v> OK… Can you come at 10 o'clock?

00:00:31.972 --> 00:00:38.285
<v><b>Instructor:</b></v> Yes, I can. The lessons are one hour, so 10.00 to 11.00, OK?

00:00:38.424 --> 00:00:39.134
<v><b>Anna:</b></v> Great!

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.240
<v><b>Instructor:</b></v> What’s your name and address?

00:00:41.554 --> 00:00:43.882
<v><b>Anna:</b></v> It’s Anna Jones…